msgstr "A forcing chain, on every board, layered on top of the chains, coloring, fish, wings and subsets the earlier tiers already require. X-Chain, XY-Chain, Simple Coloring and AIC will carry you far, but never all the way through; a <0>Nishio forcing chain</0> is the usual way to break the deadlock."

