#: src/difficulty/components/medium-sudoku-page/medium-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Our sample of {sampleSize} Medium boards measures SE {seRatingRange}, and {singlesOnlyPuzzleCount} of {sampleSize} finished on singles alone — this is the first tier where that number is zero by construction. The most common hardest step in the sample is the <0/>, and the hardest anything reached is the <1/>. Players who read pencil marks fluently clear a Medium board noticeably faster than players relying on mental candidate tracking, who will find this the first tier that genuinely rewards writing candidates down. The full per-tier data sits in our <2>sudoku difficulty rating guide</2>."
msgstr "Our sample of {sampleSize} Medium boards measures SE {seRatingRange}, and {singlesOnlyPuzzleCount} of {sampleSize} finished on singles alone — this is the first tier where that number is zero by construction. The most common hardest step in the sample is the <0/>, and the hardest anything reached is the <1/>. Players who read pencil marks fluently clear a Medium board noticeably faster than players relying on mental candidate tracking, who will find this the first tier that genuinely rewards writing candidates down. The full per-tier data sits in our <2>sudoku difficulty rating guide</2>."

